{
  "name": "15 · WhatsApp Business Auto-Reply + Lead Capture (Sales)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 15 · WhatsApp Business Auto-Reply + Lead Capture (Sales)\n**What it does:** Receives WhatsApp messages via webhook → AI classifies intent (lead/support/spam/general) → captures lead data → logs to CRM (Sheets) → alerts sales team on Slack → sends auto-reply.\n\n**Why it sells:** WhatsApp is THE business channel in India, LatAm, SEA. Every SMB needs auto-replies + lead capture. **Sell at:** $500-900 setup + $150-300/mo.\n\n**Setup:** Add your WhatsApp Business API credential (Header Auth: Bearer token) to the 'Send WhatsApp Reply' node. The lead capture + CRM logging works even without it configured.",
        "height": 130,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "s15-title",
      "name": "Sticky: Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Input\n**Webhook** receives WhatsApp message:\n- from (phone number)\n- message text\n- timestamp\n- profile name (if available)\n\n**Demo:** manual trigger with sample messages.\nValidate: phone format, message not empty.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "s15-input",
      "name": "Sticky: Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### AI Classification\nGemini classifies each message:\n- Intent: lead / support / spam / general\n- Suggested reply (contextual, helpful)\n- Lead data extraction (name, company, need) if intent=lead\n- Confidence score\n\nConfidence gate: low-confidence → flag for human review.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "s15-ai",
      "name": "Sticky: AI Classification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Output (lead capture is the core value)\n- Log ALL messages to audit trail (Sheets)\n- If lead: capture data to CRM (Sheets) + alert sales on Slack\n- Send auto-reply via WhatsApp API (side-branch, non-blocking)\n\nThe WhatsApp send is a separate branch so lead capture succeeds even if the send credential isn't configured yet.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "s15-output",
      "name": "Sticky: Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1180,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "whatsapp-message",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "s15-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook: WhatsApp Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -320,
        20
      ],
      "webhookId": "s15-webhook-whatsapp-001"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "s15-manual",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "\n// Demo WhatsApp messages. PRODUCTION: replace with webhook body from WhatsApp Business API.\nconst messages = [\n  { from: \"+919876543210\", message: \"Hi, I'm interested in your automation services. We're a marketing agency with 20 clients. Can you help us automate client reporting?\", timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), profileName: \"Rahul Sharma\" },\n  { from: \"+919876543211\", message: \"My workflow is broken. The Gmail node keeps failing with auth errors. Help!\", timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), profileName: \"Priya Patel\" },\n  { from: \"+919876543212\", message: \"Buy cheap followers now! Click here: spam.link\", timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), profileName: \"Spam Bot\" }\n];\nreturn messages.map(m => ({ json: { ...m, EventKey: \"whatsapp:\" + m.from + \":\" + m.timestamp } }));\n"
      },
      "id": "s15-messages",
      "name": "WhatsApp Messages (Demo)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -60,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "\nconst m = $json;\nconst phoneOk = /^\\+?[1-9]\\d{1,14}$/.test(String(m.from || '').replace(/[\\s-]/g, ''));\nconst ok = phoneOk && m.message && String(m.message).trim().length > 0;\nif (!ok) return { json: { Timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), EventKey: m.EventKey || 'unknown',\n  Workflow: 'whatsapp-automation', Status: 'rejected_invalid_message', Reason: 'bad phone or empty message' } };\nreturn { json: { ...m, input_valid: true } };\n"
      },
      "id": "s15-validate",
      "name": "Validate Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.input_valid === true }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "s15-if-valid",
      "name": "Message Valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "models/gemma-4-31b-it"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a WhatsApp business assistant. Classify this incoming message and generate an appropriate reply.\n\nMESSAGE:\n- From: {{ $json.profileName || $json.from }}\n- Text: {{ $json.message }}\n\nGenerate exactly this JSON (no markdown fences):\n{\n  \"intent\": \"<lead|support|spam|general>\",\n  \"reply\": \"<helpful, contextual reply in 1-3 sentences>\",\n  \"leadData\": {\n    \"name\": \"<extracted name or null>\",\n    \"company\": \"<extracted company or null>\",\n    \"need\": \"<what they need, 1 sentence>\"\n  },\n  \"confidence\": <0.0-1.0>\n}\n\nClassification guidelines:\n- lead: expressing interest in services, asking about pricing, mentioning business needs\n- support: asking for help with a technical issue, reporting a bug\n- spam: unsolicited, promotional, suspicious links\n- general: greetings, small talk, unclear intent\n\nYour ENTIRE response must be that single JSON object."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "s15-gemini",
      "name": "Gemini: Classify Message",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        -40
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "B8oepyrWrBGFl6Ud",
          "name": "Google Gemini (portfolio)"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "\nconst raw = $json.content?.parts?.filter(p => !p.thought).map(p => p.text || '').join('') ?? $json.text ?? '';\nconst cleaned = raw.replace(/```json/gi,'').replace(/```/g,'').trim();\nlet data = null;\nfor (const c of (cleaned.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/g) || []).reverse()) {\n  try { const p = JSON.parse(c); if (p && p.intent) { data = p; break; } } catch(e){}\n}\nconst msg = $('Validate Message').item.json;\nif (!data) return { json: { ...msg, parse_ok: false, error: 'AI output unparseable',\n  intent: 'general', reply: 'Thanks for your message! We\\'ll get back to you soon.', leadData: {}, confidence: 0.5 } };\nconst confidence = typeof data.confidence === 'number' ? data.confidence : 0.7;\nreturn { json: { ...msg, ...data, confidence, parse_ok: true } };\n"
      },
      "id": "s15-parse",
      "name": "Parse Classification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        980,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "\nconst m = $json;\nconst ld = m.leadData || {};\nreturn { json: {\n  Timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n  EventKey: m.EventKey,\n  Workflow: 'whatsapp-automation',\n  From: m.from,\n  ProfileName: m.profileName || ld.name || 'Unknown',\n  Message: m.message,\n  Intent: m.intent,\n  Reply: m.reply,\n  Company: ld.company || 'Unknown',\n  Need: ld.need || (m.intent === 'lead' ? m.message.slice(0, 200) : ''),\n  Confidence: m.confidence,\n  Status: 'classified',\n  ReplayPolicy: 'idempotent_skip'\n}};\n"
      },
